00:32:02.710 --> 00:32:04.830
And that is available.

00:32:04.830 --> 00:32:05.840
&gt;&gt; That's great.

00:32:05.840 --> 00:32:06.840
Thanks.

00:32:06.840 --> 00:32:07.840
&gt;&gt; Yep.

00:32:07.840 --> 00:32:11.299
&gt;&gt; Hi, this is Danny Soriay.

